    "overview": "Meet a little robot with a real job. Mission Control turns Codex lifecycle events into expressions, lights, and movement you can read at a glance.",
    "sections": [
      {
        "title": "A companion for your workflow",
        "body": "Configure **local Codex hooks** to let the scene respond to trusted lifecycle events. Working, waiting, and finishing become visible changes in the robot."
      },
      {
        "title": "Clear boundaries",
        "body": "This is an independent companion, not an OpenAI account dashboard. It responds to local events without reading your prompts, responses, or tool output."
